      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:00:16Z",
      "text": "The Houthi–Saudi conflict is an ongoing armed conflict involving the Armed Forces of Saudi Arabia and Houthi forces in Yemen and along the Saudi–Yemeni border, including parts of Asir, Jazan,…",
